00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:57.900
And like, I mean, 1 Corinthians 13, 12, another letter written by Paul, for now we see in a mirror

00:36:57.900 --> 00:37:04.400
dimly, but then face to face. Now I know in part, then I shall know fully, even as I have been fully

00:37:04.400 --> 00:37:10.220
known. We're not going to understand everything right now. I thank God that Christian faith,

00:37:10.400 --> 00:37:16.320
the scriptures, they're intellectually consistent, reliable, trustworthy. I think they make more

00:37:16.320 --> 00:37:22.180
sense out of the world as a worldview by far than any other system philosophically or otherwise that

