there is out there. That's all real, and yet there are still some things that we're not fully going

00:37:26.140 --> 00:37:32.080
to understand. I share this again to say there should be some room in your faith in Christ for

00:37:32.080 --> 00:37:37.480
some mystery, because if there are some things we're not going to fully understand, and I would

00:37:37.480 --> 00:37:42.600
ask us to caution ourselves in a couple ways around that, because there's a risk that for some

00:37:42.600 --> 00:37:47.420
