00:37:47.420 --> 00:37:53.610
and critiquing God when we don't understand things about his will. And no matter how we

00:37:53.610 --> 00:37:57.470
try to wrestle with God, we should not put ourselves in a place of being judged over

00:37:57.470 --> 00:38:02.090
him, critiquing him, saying, God, why don't you just see things the way that I do? I'm

00:38:02.090 --> 00:38:06.350
trying to make sense of this for you, God. I'm doing you a favor. For some of us, maybe

00:38:06.350 --> 00:38:11.050
it's we try to rescue God from ways we think that his plan doesn't make sense. We think

00:38:11.050 --> 00:38:16.770
our way is going to be a better way. I would encourage us to have a humble posture, even as

00:38:16.770 --> 00:38:25.350
we study the scriptures, to say God is revealing himself and his plan and his will, these mysteries

00:38:25.350 --> 00:38:30.050
to me, and some of it I can understand the way that people in the past couldn't, like the Jewish

00:38:30.050 --> 00:38:33.730
people in the Old Testament, they couldn't understand this fully. I can understand this now

00:38:33.730 --> 00:38:38.630
because it's revealed to me. There's other stuff I can't fully understand yet, but one day I'm not

00:38:38.630 --> 00:38:43.150
going to see through a mirror dimly anymore. I'm going to fully know. And so I can wrestle with

00:38:43.150 --> 00:38:50.370
this, but I can also trust and rest in this. And I think this is so important because ultimately

00:38:50.370 --> 00:38:55.890
God wants us to be able to rest and trust in him and his word and what's been revealed to us.

00:38:56.450 --> 00:39:01.030
So he's making known to us this mystery. And here in this passage, the specific mystery

00:39:01.030 --> 00:39:06.810
that's being made known is that God's will, purpose, and plan. He's saying that it's being

00:39:06.810 --> 00:39:13.350
laid out for you now. God's telling you directly, this is what it is. My plan, he says, is being set

00:39:13.350 --> 00:39:19.510
forth in Christ. That means that his plan is revealed in the person and work of Jesus. It's

00:39:19.510 --> 00:39:24.850
fulfilled in Jesus. This is what's being laid out for you here so you can fully understand it. And

00:39:24.850 --> 00:39:29.890
this is a plan for the fullness of time. What does that mean? That means that before time began,

00:39:29.890 --> 00:39:34.630
it started. That means when time reaches its fulfillment at the end of history, it will be

00:39:34.630 --> 00:39:39.850
finished, that means in the fullness of time, because God sees all of it, he is going to bring

00:39:39.850 --> 00:39:45.990
to fulfillment his plans and his purposes. And specifically that plan and purpose is to unite

00:39:45.990 --> 00:39:52.770
all things in heaven and earth. To unite all things in heaven and earth. And that means that

00:39:52.770 --> 00:39:58.910
his plan is to completely redeem and restore the division between sinful humanity in a broken

00:39:58.910 --> 00:40:04.270
creation and God's eternal kingdom of righteousness and peace. That's what God wants to do.

00:40:04.630 --> 00:40:08.430
And remember, like, does this have to do with conflict between people?

00:40:08.890 --> 00:40:14.690
Like, warring societies, armies fighting each other, politicians screaming at each other,

00:40:15.030 --> 00:40:17.630
cultures hating each other.

00:40:17.850 --> 00:40:19.110
Like, does it have to do with that?

00:40:19.210 --> 00:40:19.890
Yes, it does.

00:40:19.890 --> 00:40:26.490
But where that redemption and reconciliation happens is not just among those people by themselves on earth.

00:40:26.570 --> 00:40:29.370
It only happens in relationship with God through Jesus Christ.

00:40:30.390 --> 00:40:31.630
That's the only way that it happens.

00:40:32.270 --> 00:40:35.030
And we see that being described for us in Revelation, don't we?

00:40:35.250 --> 00:40:37.610
Revelation 21, 1-5, one of my favorite passages.

00:40:37.990 --> 00:40:40.310
Then I saw a new heaven and a new earth.

00:40:40.390 --> 00:40:44.370
For the first heaven and the first earth had passed away, and the sea was no more.

00:40:44.370 --> 00:40:48.310
And I saw the holy city, New Jerusalem, coming down out of heaven from God,

00:40:48.610 --> 00:40:50.670
prepared as a bride adorned for her husband.

00:40:50.990 --> 00:40:53.030
And I heard a loud voice from the throne saying,

00:40:53.190 --> 00:40:55.230
Behold, the dwelling place of God is with man.

00:40:55.930 --> 00:40:58.510
He will dwell with them, and they will be his people.

00:40:58.690 --> 00:41:00.750
And God himself will be with them as their God.

00:41:00.750 --> 00:41:04.470
He will wipe away every tear from their eyes, and death shall be no more.

00:41:04.790 --> 00:41:09.650
Neither shall there be mourning, nor crying, nor pain anymore, for the former things have passed away.

00:41:09.890 --> 00:41:13.590
And he who was seated on the throne said, Behold, I am making all things new.

00:41:14.590 --> 00:41:16.550
This is the hope that we look forward to.

00:41:17.310 --> 00:41:22.430
God is going to, in his great plan, his will, his purpose,

00:41:22.770 --> 00:41:27.810
he is going to unite all things in heaven and earth, bringing everything together

00:41:27.810 --> 00:41:31.790
at the throne of Jesus Christ with everything being made new,

00:41:32.130 --> 00:41:36.690
all the stain of sin being wiped away, nobody enslaved to sin any longer.

00:41:36.990 --> 00:41:40.710
That is God's plan and purpose that he desires for all of us.

00:41:40.710 --> 00:41:43.690
And I think every single one of us here right now can recognize

00:41:43.690 --> 00:41:46.090
this is definitely not the way the world is right now.

00:41:47.590 --> 00:41:50.870
And in fact, we should be honest that the world around us,

00:41:51.270 --> 00:41:54.310
trying to fix itself, where there's a lot of good things people can try to do,

00:41:54.770 --> 00:41:57.170
People can try to do great humanitarian work,

00:41:57.650 --> 00:41:59.550
great acts of generosity and servant,

00:41:59.710 --> 00:42:01.070
humanly speaking, great things.

00:42:01.250 --> 00:42:02.650
