00:42:07.070 --> 00:42:08.430
We should be honest with that

00:42:08.430 --> 00:42:10.910
and say we actually have a greater hope,

00:42:11.190 --> 00:42:12.130
a greater solution,

00:42:12.830 --> 00:42:15.310
a mystery offered to us in the pages of Scripture

00:42:15.310 --> 00:42:16.930
through God's Son, Jesus Christ.

00:42:17.390 --> 00:42:19.150
And really, when we look at the world around us

00:42:19.150 --> 00:42:20.890
and see that lack of hope,

00:42:21.610 --> 00:42:23.290
we should also be able to look at ourselves

00:42:23.290 --> 00:42:25.990
