00:42:26.350 --> 00:42:30.110
and realize that maybe we're not living this out right now either.

00:42:31.290 --> 00:42:34.530
We aren't yet that bride adorned for her husband.

00:42:35.910 --> 00:42:36.730
Why is that?

00:42:37.190 --> 00:42:41.210
Because we're not really living in the truth of the gospel

00:42:41.210 --> 00:42:42.850
that we're talking about today.

00:42:44.290 --> 00:42:45.690
So think about that.

00:42:46.350 --> 00:42:48.010
This is a great challenge for us.

00:42:48.690 --> 00:42:51.150
This idea of higher calling that we have this year.

00:42:51.830 --> 00:42:57.030
Again, there's parts of that higher calling that are about serving God, taking steps of faith,

