stuff like that that I think are beautiful and wonderful to see, but it must start in our

00:43:00.930 --> 00:43:06.290
relationship with God. Are we living in relationship with God and then even with

00:43:06.290 --> 00:43:13.510
other people in a way that reflects and magnifies and testifies to God's plan accomplished through

00:43:13.510 --> 00:43:19.170
his son, Jesus Christ? And I think the hard reality of that is for many of us, this is not what our

00:43:19.170 --> 00:43:25.370
lives look like right now. God is inviting us into that. And for many of us, I want us to wrestle

00:43:25.370 --> 00:43:29.450
with the fact that this might actually be damaging to our faith, the way we're living right now.

00:43:30.050 --> 00:43:37.290
Because while God says you're forgiven and redeemed, you're purchased out of slavery,

00:43:38.050 --> 00:43:42.430
the record of your guilt is wiped clean. For many of us, that's not how we're living in

00:43:42.430 --> 00:43:49.010
relationship with God or with other people. How do I know that? How many of us are living right

00:43:49.010 --> 00:43:59.690
now ensnared in that web of lies and deception. It's got a hold on us. We're scared. If we bring

00:43:59.690 --> 00:44:03.770
it to the surface, we bring it to God. If we bring it to other people, I feel like we're going to be

00:44:03.770 --> 00:44:11.890
rejected. How many of us, living condemned by past mistakes, were scared to death that somebody

00:44:11.890 --> 00:44:19.170
would find out what we've done before? And when we live that way, while we say we believe the gospel

00:44:19.170 --> 00:44:23.790
of Jesus Christ, everything in our lives, our relationship with God, our relationship with

00:44:23.790 --> 00:44:29.590
others actually testifies the opposite. And this is why today I don't want to gloss over this.

00:44:30.130 --> 00:44:34.530
I don't want to gloss over this problem of sin and how this affects us. I want us to really dig

00:44:34.530 --> 00:44:40.170
into that and realize God has revealed his plan through Jesus so that we can join him in that plan.

00:44:40.290 --> 00:44:45.290
Like that one thing I shared at the beginning, trust God's gracious plan to unite all things in

