00:45:44.590 --> 00:45:46.830
Oh, well, yeah, I did this, but man, that person over there,

00:45:46.910 --> 00:45:47.830
they're much worse than me.

00:45:47.870 --> 00:45:49.830
They did that, so what I did isn't really that bad.

00:45:50.810 --> 00:45:52.690
Or even trying to redeem ourselves.

00:45:53.550 --> 00:45:54.890
Yeah, maybe I did that bad thing,

00:45:55.350 --> 00:45:56.590
