00:46:01.550 --> 00:46:03.030
Look at how generous I am.

00:46:03.370 --> 00:46:06.770
Maybe even, as we realize, probably realize for a second,

00:46:06.850 --> 00:46:08.370
this isn't just how the world deals with sin.

00:46:08.370 --> 00:46:09.810
This is how many of us deal with sin.

00:46:11.130 --> 00:46:13.530
Maybe it's even, look how much I'm serving God.

00:46:16.500 --> 00:46:18.720
God, look how faithful I am in worshiping you.

00:46:21.130 --> 00:46:22.750
God, look how much more scripture I know

00:46:22.750 --> 00:46:24.130
than that person next to me.

00:46:25.270 --> 00:46:27.370
God, look how many more missions trips I've gone on.

00:46:27.670 --> 00:46:30.190
God, look how much I sacrifice my time and energy for you.

00:46:30.550 --> 00:46:33.450
God, doesn't that cover over these things that I've done?

00:46:34.750 --> 00:46:35.510
And brothers and sisters,

00:46:35.710 --> 00:46:39.030
it's not just that this is like the wrong way to handle it.

00:46:39.030 --> 00:46:41.570
You don't have to live under this weight any longer.

00:46:42.650 --> 00:46:44.170
You don't have to hide.

00:46:44.410 --> 00:46:45.690
You don't have to pretend.

00:46:45.970 --> 00:46:47.250
You don't have to justify yourself.

00:46:47.370 --> 00:46:49.190
You don't have to compare and compete with others.

00:46:49.330 --> 00:46:51.510
You don't have to try to redeem yourself any longer.

00:46:51.950 --> 00:46:53.970
As the church, as followers of Jesus,

00:46:54.190 --> 00:46:56.630
we can actually be honest about our sin

00:46:56.630 --> 00:46:58.850
and live in freedom and our need for grace

00:46:58.850 --> 00:47:01.590
because the debt's already been paid by Jesus Christ.

00:47:02.290 --> 00:47:03.430
It's already been paid.

00:47:04.270 --> 00:47:05.710
You don't have to pay for it anymore.

00:47:06.370 --> 00:47:07.510
You don't have to hide from it.

00:47:07.530 --> 00:47:08.850
You don't have to cover it up anymore.

00:47:08.930 --> 00:47:10.770
You don't have to try to redeem yourself anymore.

00:47:11.170 --> 00:47:13.050
The price has already been paid.

00:47:13.170 --> 00:47:14.170
Can you tell somebody next to you,

00:47:14.170 --> 00:47:15.410
The price has already been paid.

00:47:18.100 --> 00:47:19.740
And I want to encourage us.

00:47:20.200 --> 00:47:22.780
Like, learn, like, how do you deal with this problem of sin?

00:47:22.980 --> 00:47:28.020
The way that we do that, the way we do that is actually first with God and then with others.

00:47:28.520 --> 00:47:32.900
That we bring that to God and say, God, this is the way that I've turned away from you.

00:47:33.380 --> 00:47:34.800
