00:47:39.260 --> 00:47:40.420
I'm not going to compare anymore.

00:47:40.520 --> 00:47:43.140
God, I'm just going to be honest about my sin.

00:47:43.140 --> 00:47:45.360
and I'm gonna bring it to you

00:47:45.360 --> 00:47:47.300
and I'm gonna trust that Jesus

00:47:47.300 --> 00:47:50.220
through that blood shed on the cross,

00:47:50.820 --> 00:47:52.240
that blood that redeems,

00:47:52.600 --> 00:47:53.920
that blood that forgives,

00:47:54.220 --> 00:47:55.420
that it set me free.

00:47:56.100 --> 00:47:58.220
The weight can be lifted from my shoulders.

00:47:58.460 --> 00:48:00.180
I don't need to hide from you anymore, God,

00:48:00.240 --> 00:48:01.820
and I don't need to hide from others either

00:48:01.820 --> 00:48:03.800
