like some of the way that he decisions he was making ways he was leading stuff like that and

00:48:53.340 --> 00:48:58.060
I was not in a good place spiritually I don't think again like being a leader doesn't mean you're not

00:48:58.060 --> 00:49:03.100
struggling spiritually and out of that there was just this bitterness in my heart this judgment in

00:49:03.100 --> 00:49:07.780
my heart and I started I was just like getting really angry at this other person serving in

00:49:07.780 --> 00:49:12.380
leadership. And I was, I would, and I knew I shouldn't, like, do anything really outwardly,

00:49:12.380 --> 00:49:16.700
but what I would do is, like, I would, you know, kind of say passive-aggressive comments

00:49:16.700 --> 00:49:22.460
to him and, like, to him or about him in meetings that we were having. I would, like, go and, like,

00:49:22.480 --> 00:49:26.040
tell somebody else, like, man, you see what that decision that guy made? Like, it's a stupid

00:49:26.040 --> 00:49:31.780
decision. Like, I would, and I would do everything but directly confront the issue. And in doing

