that this other person was so much worse than me. And instead of dealing with that in a way,

00:49:49.000 --> 00:49:56.140
like, lavished with the grace of God like we can do, instead, I was doing that passive aggressively,

00:49:56.600 --> 00:50:00.980
critically, condemning him, tearing him down. I was doing all that stuff. And it wasn't until a

00:50:00.980 --> 00:50:05.140
brother came along and confronted me and said, Pete, what you're doing is not right. This is not

00:50:05.140 --> 00:50:10.280
how you live in the grace and mercy of God. And he challenged me, and I realized I had to go to that

00:50:10.280 --> 00:50:14.920
brother. I had to confess to him. I had to say, hey, I apologize. I've been critical and judgmental

00:50:14.920 --> 00:50:21.200
toward you. Will you forgive me? And you know what? That brother forgave me. We were able to love each

00:50:21.200 --> 00:50:26.140
other, care for each other, be friends with each other, because the grace of God covered that. I had

00:50:26.140 --> 00:50:32.400
to learn that the hard way. My fear is that we can come here, we can do the things we do on Sunday

00:50:32.400 --> 00:50:36.960
in our life groups, all that, we can serve, we can do all the stuff that we do, and behind the scenes

00:50:36.960 --> 00:50:42.160
where we're actually living our relationship with God and others is just rotten with sin.

00:50:43.280 --> 00:50:47.900
So how do you deal with that? And by the way, I just want to give an invitation here today. There

00:50:47.900 --> 00:50:53.120
are some of you, maybe you are checking out the Christian faith, maybe you know the weight of trying

00:50:53.120 --> 00:50:57.720
to deal with your own sin and maybe you've known it for a long time. You've been trying to hide.

00:50:58.440 --> 00:51:03.940
You've been trying to pay the price yourself and trying to pretend it isn't enslaving you

00:51:03.940 --> 00:51:09.900
when you really know that it is. Can I invite you today to be in Christ with us? It's not that

00:51:09.900 --> 00:51:15.580
this is a perfect community, but we follow a Savior who has given his life for us. He shed

00:51:15.580 --> 00:51:19.820
his blood on the cross, not just for the person sitting next to you, but for you. And today I want

00:51:19.820 --> 00:51:27.140
you to be in Christ, meaning that you trust his sacrifice for you, that through the blood he shed

00:51:27.140 --> 00:51:31.760
on the cross, he has set you free from slavery, and he's set you free from guilt. It's atoned for.

00:51:32.340 --> 00:51:37.960
Can you pray to him today? Trust in him today. Say, I'm placing my faith in Jesus as my Savior today.

00:51:38.040 --> 00:51:42.960
I want to follow him and live in his grace today. I would love for you to do that even on your own

00:51:42.960 --> 00:51:46.300
now in your relationship with God, but maybe come and talk to one of the prayer team afterward

00:51:46.300 --> 00:51:49.240
and say, hey, I'm choosing to place my faith in Jesus today.

00:51:49.400 --> 00:51:51.380
I want to give you that invitation this morning.

00:51:52.220 --> 00:51:54.200
As we want to live in that together,

00:51:54.280 --> 00:51:56.340
can I also ask you, are you living in unity

00:51:56.340 --> 00:51:57.860
with your brothers and sisters in Christ?

00:51:59.380 --> 00:52:00.600
Are you living in unity?

00:52:01.760 --> 00:52:03.320
Where have things like unforgiveness,

00:52:04.000 --> 00:52:06.780
comparison, gossip, jealousy,

00:52:07.580 --> 00:52:09.140
simple personality differences,

00:52:09.340 --> 00:52:11.340
where have these caused division among us?

00:52:11.820 --> 00:52:13.840
And is there maybe a conflict or a conversation

00:52:13.840 --> 00:52:15.820
you've been avoiding rather than trusting God

00:52:15.820 --> 00:52:17.140
to redeem and restore?

00:52:18.240 --> 00:52:20.540
And lastly, thirdly, do you trust God

00:52:20.540 --> 00:52:22.000
to work out his purpose and plan?

00:52:22.880 --> 00:52:24.460
This is kind of getting back to the mystery stuff

00:52:24.460 --> 00:52:25.060
I shared earlier.

00:52:25.780 --> 00:52:29.100
A lot of us, we struggle to really follow and trust God

00:52:29.100 --> 00:52:30.960
because we're like, God, it doesn't make sense to me.

00:52:31.560 --> 00:52:33.820
I don't see the whole road map yet.

00:52:33.900 --> 00:52:35.900
Again, I talked before, God doesn't give you a road map,

00:52:35.980 --> 00:52:36.780
God gives you a compass.

00:52:38.400 --> 00:52:40.000
We're like, God, I just can't follow you yet.

00:52:40.020 --> 00:52:42.320
I can't fully trust because I don't know everything.

00:52:43.040 --> 00:52:46.780
Can I ask you today, can you trust that God has a purpose?

00:52:47.000 --> 00:52:48.060
God has a plan.

00:52:48.320 --> 00:52:51.460
It's a plan bigger than you or I could possibly conceive of

00:52:51.460 --> 00:52:54.320
because it's been from before time until the end of time.

00:52:54.320 --> 00:52:57.560
But his plan will be accomplished through his son, Jesus Christ.

00:52:57.880 --> 00:52:59.100
Can we believe that today?

00:52:59.940 --> 00:53:04.380
Because when we trust that plan, then we can actually rest

00:53:04.380 --> 00:53:08.600
and have peace in our hearts even when we don't fully understand.

00:53:08.600 --> 00:53:16.400
end. And if we trust in that plan, then we can actually take steps of faith in response to God.

00:53:17.000 --> 00:53:20.880
And even when we can't fully control everything, but we can respond to God and say, God, I'm going

00:53:20.880 --> 00:53:24.580
to take a step of faith today. And a lot of times we think, oh, it's a step of faith. Yeah, that's

00:53:24.580 --> 00:53:29.000
serving God in some way. That's going on missions. Maybe that step of faith today is simply confessing

00:53:29.000 --> 00:53:34.300
your sin to God. Saying, God, I can't fix this. Maybe that step of faith today is I need to reach

00:53:34.300 --> 00:53:39.820
out to my sister because I need to confess something to her. Maybe that step of faith is

00:53:39.820 --> 00:53:43.120
I need to place my faith in Jesus for the first time, even though I can't fully understand.

00:53:44.200 --> 00:53:50.920
Can we trust that God's plans are better than ours and then live in that truth together? Let's

00:53:50.920 --> 00:54:08.030
spend some time in response today. Can I invite us to stand together? As we're standing here,

00:54:08.830 --> 00:54:14.510
again, I want to just kind of create some space here for us personally to respond to God first.

00:54:15.430 --> 00:54:16.770
So just kind of bow your head with me

00:54:16.770 --> 00:54:19.510
and maybe you want to just reflect through

00:54:19.510 --> 00:54:21.810
some of those questions I just asked you.

00:54:22.970 --> 00:54:24.890
How am I dealing with the problem of sin?

00:54:26.840 --> 00:54:27.740
Am I living in unity?

00:54:27.880 --> 00:54:31.180
God wants to unite everything in heaven and earth.

00:54:31.680 --> 00:54:33.540
All those warring nations,

00:54:33.860 --> 00:54:36.600
all those tribes that hate one another,

00:54:36.740 --> 00:54:38.400
all those divided relationships,

00:54:38.840 --> 00:54:41.200
everything he wants to bring together in Christ.

00:54:41.200 --> 00:54:44.220
Am I simply living in unity with my brothers and sisters?

00:54:47.280 --> 00:54:49.940
Am I trusting that God's plans are better than mine?

00:54:53.310 --> 00:54:55.130
Maybe you want to just sit with those questions here

00:54:55.130 --> 00:54:56.270
for a moment before God.

00:54:57.650 --> 00:54:59.690
And as we have this time to respond,

00:55:00.070 --> 00:55:00.990
just as I've shared before,

00:55:01.070 --> 00:55:02.390
we really want this to be like

00:55:02.390 --> 00:55:04.530
we must seek intimacy with God.

00:55:05.270 --> 00:55:07.190
We must seek fellowship with him.

00:55:07.310 --> 00:55:08.730
Have the hard conversation.

00:55:11.580 --> 00:55:12.720
Rest in the truth.

00:55:14.160 --> 00:55:16.680
Rejoice in the promises fulfilled in Christ.

00:55:18.520 --> 00:55:20.080
Celebrate his faithfulness.

00:55:21.580 --> 00:55:23.260
Mourn the things that have been lost.

00:55:24.820 --> 00:55:26.440
Be honest about the pain.

00:55:29.350 --> 00:55:30.610
Be honest about the confusion.

00:55:31.970 --> 00:55:35.250
Bring that to God and in relationship with him in this space,

00:55:35.350 --> 00:55:38.790
let's believe that he is calling us to that higher calling

00:55:38.790 --> 00:55:42.270
that starts with deep relationship and fellowship with him.

00:55:43.090 --> 00:55:45.310
I'm going to just pray for that for us here for a moment.

00:55:45.970 --> 00:55:48.490
After I pray, just kind of have a short open time

00:55:48.490 --> 00:55:50.070
just for you to pray and seek the Lord

00:55:50.070 --> 00:55:52.510
and then the worship team is going to lead us in a couple songs.

00:55:53.150 --> 00:55:55.690
And let's let this be a space to respond to God,

00:55:55.770 --> 00:55:57.930
to seek him, to say, God, I need to know you.

00:55:57.950 --> 00:55:59.130
I must know you more.

00:55:59.810 --> 00:56:01.570
So God, we invite you here again.

00:56:01.710 --> 00:56:06.250
Come, Holy Spirit, work in each and every heart.

00:56:07.270 --> 00:56:09.750
Give us the gift of faith and trust.

00:56:10.870 --> 00:56:12.630
Set us free in this moment.

00:56:13.170 --> 00:56:15.350
The power of the blood of Jesus Christ.

00:56:16.350 --> 00:56:18.230
Sanctify us through and through.

00:56:18.230 --> 00:56:21.030
Set us free from the things that have been enslaving us

00:56:21.030 --> 00:56:22.090
and bonding us.

00:56:23.150 --> 00:56:26.410
Wash us clean, God, of all the guilt and all the shame.

00:56:27.210 --> 00:56:29.710
Invite us into your great plan

00:56:29.710 --> 00:56:32.470
to know that our lives have a purpose

00:56:32.470 --> 00:56:35.390
to be part of what you're doing until the end of time.

00:56:36.650 --> 00:56:39.770
Invite us into that, Lord, and especially draw us near, Lord,

00:56:40.270 --> 00:56:41.710
that we would be close to you,

00:56:41.970 --> 00:56:43.290
that we would know you more,

00:56:43.290 --> 00:56:46.950
that we would know you so personally and intimately in this moment, Lord.

00:56:47.490 --> 00:56:49.070
Come and speak and move.

00:56:49.590 --> 00:56:51.670
Have your way in us in this space.

00:56:51.670 --> 00:56:53.270
In Jesus' name.
